# An entry that leaves Upcoming passes the focus to the row below it in the list, not to the next block in the file.
file <<END
Work:
	- Email @due({today+1})
	- Slides @due({today+4})
Home:
	- Rent @due({today+1})
END
keys gc gU
see ▌ - Email
keys x
hide Email
see ▌ - Rent
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Email @due({today+1}) @done({today})
	- Slides @due({today+4})
Home:
	- Rent @due({today+1})
END
